Description: Stereo picture area: a hole only where the declared surface shows, the view's own opaque background around it (ORDER 504)
 Gwenview made the whole viewport transparent while a stereo picture was shown, so the strips around a picture that does not fill the view
 showed what lies behind the window. The shared layer says where the picture shows (Stereo::WidgetLayer::shownRect()).
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
